"szükségük van."

#: templates/settings/group-products.php:17
msgid "Currently supported integrations:"
msgstr "Jelenleg támogatott integrációk:"

#: templates/settings/group-recipe-collections.php:17
msgid ""
"Recipe Collections allow your visitors to save the recipes on your website "
